From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: hjviewer <haejin.cho@yonsei.ac.kr>
Date: Tue, 20 Oct 2026 05:16:51 +0900
Subject: [PATCH 129/162] hjviewer: the file transfer windows in the app's look
 (U15)

U15 (UX-S5), the desktop part, first of three commits so that each
window can be left out alone (u15.md, review). New HJViewer file
flutter/lib/common/hjv_session_look.dart maps the colours upstream
passes to the palette, as the session toolbar's
_hjvToolbarButtonColors does; the chat and port forwarding commits
use it too.

- MenuButton (desktop/widgets/menu_button.dart): its background and
  hover through hjvMenuButtonColors: the theme's cardColor (the head's
  tools) on fill with hoverStrong, the accent (a transfer card's resume
  and cancel) clear with hover, the theme's disabledColor (the close x
  while the path is typed) on fill; a button that cannot be pressed
  dims its icon to 40 % (review: it looked pressable).
- File list rows: a selected row on primarySoft with a 1 px primary
  border at 35 % (review R6: a range shows on a dull screen), its name
  in primaryStrong and its icon in primary; the right-clicked row's
  1 px primary border; borders in foregroundDecoration so the row's
  content does not shift. Date 13 px, size 12 px, textSecondary,
  digits of one width. Column heads 12/600 textTertiary, the sort
  arrow 16 px.
- Head: the platform tile 40x40 on primaryFill (white logo; the
  loading circle white, since primary does not show on primaryFill),
  'Local / Remote computer' 14/600, the tools' icons textSecondary,
  the path field's radius md. The new folder dialog's title is
  HjvDialogTitle. [Send] and [Receive] take the theme's filled and
  disabled colours; their label and arrow are white only while the
  selection is valid (as onPressed), else textDisabled. The web
  upload button is left as it is.
- Transfer list: cards with hjvCardDecoration, 20 px job icons and
  status text in textSecondary, the progress bar on primaryFill
  (review R4: white percent text reaches 4.5:1 also in the dark
  theme) over fill with the small radius, quiet resume/cancel icons;
  the empty state 32 px textTertiary icon and body text.
- The overwrite dialog (models/file_model.dart showFileConfirmDialog):
  HjvDialogTitle in the danger tone, HjvDialogWidth.md, the question
  at w600, the identical-file note as an info HjvCallout, [OK] as
  hjvDangerButton(translate('OK')) as the delete confirm has it;
  order, Enter and Esc as before.

No text changes. Test: flutter/test/hjviewer_session_look_test.dart
(pure, no bridge; the helper compares with the palette, not with
common.dart's MyTheme, so that it stays free of the bridge).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
